00:16:24,224 --> 00:16:28,816
with Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) it's his personality; He had a unique personality.

204
00:16:29,530 --> 00:16:31,854
History does not produce men like Umar(عُمَر).

