214
00:17:11,546 --> 00:17:17,286
One is, Mulhamoon(مُلْهَمُوْنَ), men, who are inspired by Allah.

215
00:17:18,770 --> 00:17:19,537
Number two,

216
00:17:19,947 --> 00:17:27,691
اَلرَّجُلُّ الصَّادِقُ الظَّنْ ، وَهُوَ مَنْ أُلْقِيَ فِيْ رَوْعِهِ شَيْءٌ مِنْ قِبَلِ الْمَلَأِ الْأَعْلَى

217
00:17:28,211 --> 00:17:37,576
The man, whose intuition is right because of something that is put in his heart.

218
00:17:39,018 --> 00:17:39,928
The third opinion:

219
00:17:39,953 --> 00:17:42,849
مَنْ يَجْرِي الصَّوَابُ عَلَى لِسَانِهِ بِغَيْرِقَصْدَ

220
00:17:43,555 --> 00:17:47,218
The one, who speaks the truth, truth flows naturally on his tongue

221
00:17:47,802 --> 00:17:49,482
without him intending.

222
00:17:50,005 --> 00:17:53,582
Without him trying, it just comes out naturally on his tongue.

223
00:17:54,453 --> 00:17:56,097
