224
00:17:56,316 --> 00:17:59,028
تُكَلِّمُهُ الْمَلَائِكَه بِغَيْرِ نَبُوَّةَ

225
00:17:59,289 --> 00:18:03,263
He is the man whom the Angels speak to, without him being a prophet,

226
00:18:05,645 --> 00:18:06,625
