00:24:04,227 --> 00:24:09,467
Dear brothers and sisters! Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) was a towering figure.

300
00:24:11,542 --> 00:24:14,997
Whenever, he would be with any group, he would be tallest among them.

