00:24:16,251 --> 00:24:21,973
And he was described as, when you see him from a distance in a group,

302
00:24:22,364 --> 00:24:27,193
you think that he is riding his mount, while everybody around him is standing.

303
00:24:29,049 --> 00:24:32,939
As if, he is on top of his camel and everybody else is standing around him.

304
00:24:33,510 --> 00:24:35,765
He was towering figure, very tall,

305
00:24:36,433 --> 00:24:39,155
whenever he would be in a group, he would be the tallest among them.

