00:24:49,953 --> 00:24:55,211
There was a lot of flesh on his bones, but it was muscle.

309
00:24:57,946 --> 00:25:02,649
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) was a wrestler, he had a body of a wrestler and he used to wrestle.

