00:25:03,275 --> 00:25:04,827
He used to be a wrestler in Jahiliyah(جاهلية)

311
00:25:05,924 --> 00:25:13,134
مَجْدُوْلَّ الّلَحَمْ، عَرِيْضَ الّقَدَمَيْنَ وَ الْيَدَيْنَ

312
00:25:13,159 --> 00:25:19,274
His limbs were large, he had large bones, large frame, and his limbs were large,

313
00:25:19,299 --> 00:25:21,813
