00:25:40,236 --> 00:25:42,724
Mashoob bi humra(مشوب بحمرة), there is some redness in his colour.

318
00:25:43,824 --> 00:25:50,257
When he was old, he used to use Hinna(حنا) in his hair, that red dye.

319
00:25:51,103 --> 00:25:54,663
