320
00:25:56,925 --> 00:26:03,025
He was described, the tips of his moustache, or what we call, the whiskers were long,

321
00:26:04,369 --> 00:26:09,197
and he used to twist them, in his fingers when he would become upset.

322
00:26:09,928 --> 00:26:13,159
