323
00:26:14,685 --> 00:26:18,876
So that adds to the presence of the personality of Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب).

324
00:26:22,930 --> 00:26:27,236
He was described as when he would walk, he would walk fast.

325
00:26:28,033 --> 00:26:30,514
When he would speak you could definitely hear him,

326
00:26:31,356 --> 00:26:35,339
and when he strikes, he strikes with strength, he hurts.

327
00:26:36,318 --> 00:26:37,675
وَإِذَا ضَرَبَ اَوْجَعْ

328
00:26:37,728 --> 00:26:39,361
When he strikes, he hurts.

329
00:26:41,230 --> 00:26:46,322
So, it was a personality of strength, his voice was strong,

330
00:26:47,006 --> 00:26:52,771
his demeanour in walking was strong, and when he strikes, he strikes with strength.

331
00:26:58,271 --> 00:27:01,253
Now, Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) had that presence,

